{
  "model": "staff.roleplay",
  "pk": 1,
  "fields": {
    "scenario": "Late Delivery\r\n\r\nYou are part of a catering team that is to deliver the set of meals ordered for the corporate event on 29/05/2026. The Butcher to deliver the beef, chicken has not show up. We have no update of when he will turn up. As the Catering Lead, demonstrate what you will do so we can meet and exceed client expectation.",
    "role": "Catering Lead",
    "description": "In the team, you have the another Catering Lead, Senior Cook, Drivers, Servers, Cooks.\r\nYou are to demonstrate your communication and teamwork skills.",
    "expected_outcome": "Effective Communication\r\nTeamwork\r\nPersonal Initiative\r\nAbility to work under pressure"
  }
},
{
  "model": "staff.roleplay",
  "pk": 2,
  "fields": {
    "scenario": "It 17:30hours on Friday evening, the catering event is in 30 minutes for 200 guests. The Chef didn't show up. One of main supplier is run late. The client called to say that the guests are waiting for the service. Demonstrate your actions working with the team of Catering Lead, Senior Cooks, Cooks, Waiters, Servers, Manager and drivers",
    "role": "Catering Lead",
    "description": "The candidate is expected to demonstrate how to lead the team under pressure in delivering expected results whilst resolving potential confusion",
    "expected_outcome": "Effective communication\r\nTeamwork\r\nWorking under pressure"
  }
},
{
  "model": "staff.roleplayresponse",
  "pk": 1,
  "fields": {
    "roleplay": 1,
    "staff": 28,
    "action": "1. Call the butcher immediately for ETA. If no response, activate backup supplier list.\r\n2. Brief the other Catering Lead and Senior Cook - we pivot to vegetarian/chicken dishes we have in stock.\r\n3. Inform client contact now about delay and present Plan B menu options to manage expectations.\r\n4. Reassign Drivers to pickup from backup supplier while Cooks start prepping sides.\r\n5. Document everything for incident report.",
    "submitted_at": "2026-05-29T12:57:39.513Z"
  }
},
